Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
xml_ffi.rs was rewritten for this branch's XmlReadState, which still tracks
namespaces with namespace_stack / seen_first_event (declared_namespaces() is
not available in the vendored xml crate): those fields use RefCell / Cell as
well and the namespace_stack borrow is released before StartElementNs() is
invoked. append_to_source() has no BOM stripping and AppendToSource() has no
XMLParserReplaceLoneSurrogates branch (neither exists on this branch).
xml_document_parser_sim_test.cc changes were not carried.

